  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Outro (over end of Dondante)**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2005-11-10kcrw.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 7 songs; 39 min; rated 4.67/5 by 3 [1]. Said about its sound: The end of this track sounds really good in this studio recording; This song is described as simply killer in the audio capture; The audio lacks crowd noise, showcasing how the songs from the album Z sound live [2][3][4]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The producer of the album Z also worked on Pink Floyd's Meddle [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2005-11-10kcrw.flac16**: taped by Mike B; transferred by N/A; source: 128kbps MP3 stream > SoundForge 7.0 (Waves L1 Ultramaximizer+ > Waves L2) > CD Wave (tracking) > FLAC Frontend [1]",
